	(lib_symbols)
	(text "ADCs. ADC k digitises RX 4(k-1)+1 ... 4k and returns one TDM line (SDOUTk). Group g (ADC 4g-3 ... 4g) shares SDAg and BCLK/FSYNC output g; A1/A0 give each ADC of a group its own I2C address."
